&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain SQL queries and analytical scripts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Engineering team to understand the commercial data model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build dashboards and reports that communicate commercial performance clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present findings to the Commercial Lead and Beauty commercial stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage ad hoc analytical requests from buying and trading teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the broader commercial analytics team — sharing knowledge and maintaining high standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
